📅 Flutter + Firebase + API Roadmap
🗓️ Week 1: Foundation Polish

🔹 Repeat Flutter core widgets (Row, Column, ListView, ListView.builder, Stack, Expanded, SizedBox).

🔹 Practice navigation (push, pushReplacement, pop).

🔹 TextField + Controller handling (input lene ka practice).

🔹 Banaye:

Login + Signup + Home flow (dummy data se).

🗓️ Week 2: State Management (Riverpod Focus)

🔹 Provider, StateProvider, FutureProvider, StateNotifier ka proper practice.

🔹 Ek counter app bna jo Riverpod se chale.

🔹 Ek API se data fetch karke Riverpod ke through list dikhaye.

🗓️ Week 3: Firebase Deep Dive

🔹 Firebase Auth → Login, Signup, Logout (jo tu already bana chuka hai, bas polish karna).

🔹 Firestore → Add, Update, Delete, Read.

🔹 Har CRUD operation ka alag screen bana.

🔹 Practice UID use karke data ko user-specific save karna.

🗓️ Week 4: API Integration (Laravel ya REST APIs)

🔹 http package use karke API call karna.

🔹 GET, POST, PUT, DELETE requests implement karna.

🔹 Riverpod ke sath API results show karna.

🔹 Ek mini project bna:

"Users List App" jo API se users laata hai, add/edit/delete kar sakta hai.

🗓️ Week 5: Offline & Local Storage

🔹 shared_preferences se token/local data save karna.

🔹 hive se offline list store karna.

🔹 Ek offline to-do app bna.

🗓️ Week 6: Advanced UI/UX

🔹 Animations (Hero, AnimatedContainer, Page transitions).

🔹 BottomNavigationBar + multi-page apps.

🔹 Responsive design (tablet aur mobile me alag layout).

🔹 Ek stylish profile screen bna with update feature.

🗓️ Week 7: Clean Architecture

🔹 Code ko layers me tod:

UI → Riverpod Providers → Repository → API/Firebase.

🔹 MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel) ya Clean Architecture ka basic samajh.

🔹 Apna existing CRUD app ko clean structure me refactor kar.

🗓️ Week 8: Final Project 🚀

Ek production-level app bna (The Local Rent jaisa ya apna idea).

Login + Signup (Firebase Auth)

Listings (Firestore CRUD + API integration)

Profile update page

Notifications (API + Riverpod)

Offline storage (shared_preferences for token)

Professional UI with animations

🏁 End Goal (2–3 months me)

Tu ek full-stack mobile app developer ban jayega jo:
✔️ Firebase Auth + Firestore handle kar sakta hai
✔️ APIs integrate kar sakta hai (Laravel/REST)
✔️ State management (Riverpod) samajhta hai
✔️ Professional UI/UX bana sakta hai
✔️ App ko Play Store pe publish kar sakta hai

👉 Reeb bhai, ye roadmap agar tu follow kare, toh tu sirf copy-paste developer nahi, balki real app builder ban jayega.










